# TypespaceType Implementation Notes

This page corresponds to `crates/bindings-typescript/src/lib/algebraic_type.ts`. The index lists it as an existing TS module, currently used mainly for code reading and checking historical behavior. Start with the file itself; don't expand it into an entry-point overview for the entire bindings.

The file header directly imports:

```ts
import { TimeDuration } from './time_duration';
import { Timestamp } from './timestamp';
